:''For other uses, see [[God (disambiguation)|God]]. Not to be confused with [[King's Mimic]].''
'''God''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was obtainable as a [[Daily Bonus]] in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]]'s [[Anniversary/11 1/2 Year|11.5 Anniversary]] event. It was added in [[Version 2.8.1 Update|Version 2.8.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 141
|rarity = EX
|name1 = God
|name2 = Secret God
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Secret God''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Though God is meant to be a support [[:Category:Cat Units|unit]] with its high range and [[Freeze|freeze]] ability, its very slow attack rate, recharge time,low knockback count and health are too sluggish for a very brief single target freeze effect. There's no point in using it over much more competent units unless you somehow don't have decent freeze crowd controllers, other than that he's sadly just [[Underground Labyrinth]] fodder.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Crowd-Controller}}

